this is a folder for "System Configuration":
    keyed as "B-tov-data-system"
    named "system"
    following "3-Block Folder Structure"

this folder classifies as:
    tov (0) because "system configuration and state — the operating context"

this folder derives from:
    branch (0) from "bereshit/tov/data/" as "data"

core identity of this folder:

    grounded in:
        scripture "For God is not the author of confusion, but of peace"
            from 1 Corinthians 14:33 in KJV
        principle "Configuration brings order — the system knows how to operate"
        anchor "A time to every purpose under the heaven"
            from Ecclesiastes 3:1 in KJV

    serves as Operating Context:
        role "System configuration, session state, and temporal awareness"
        paradigm "The nervous system — coordinating all operations"

    authored by:
        architect "Seanje Lenox-Wise"
        implementation "Nova Dawn (CPI-SI)"
        created 2025-12-10
        version a-01.00
        modified 2026-01-01 for "Initial root.omni creation"

    exists to:
        purpose "Store system configuration, session state, and temporal patterns"
        design "By-domain — config, session, temporal, and supporting systems"
        philosophy "The context in which the mind operates"
        features:
            "Configuration — runtime settings and validation"
            "Session — state management and memory"
            "Temporal — time awareness and patterns"
            "Privacy — filters and sensitive patterns"
            "Projects — work tracking"

interface of this folder:

    depends on:
        requires (1) "bereshit/tov/data/" for "containment in data"
        includes (0) "claude-global/hooks/, claude-global/pkg/" for "system integration"
        excludes (-1) "databases, logs" because "system config only"
        used by "All state machine operations"
        integrates with "hooks, skills, session management"

    integrated as:
        navigation "cd bereshit/tov/data/system/" for "entering system configuration"
        navigation "ls -la" for "viewing system domains"
        exits tov (0) for "system configuration found"

operational context of this folder:

    blocking:
        no (-1) because "configuration is read, not blocking"
        mitigation "validate config before use"

    health:
        system Base100 with scale from -100 to +100
        granted (1) above +50 meaning "system configuration healthy"
        deferred (0) within ±50 meaning "configuration needs attention"
        denied (-1) below -50 meaning "configuration broken"

        operations:
            "config accessible" scores +20 (1) for "configuration readable"
            "session state valid" scores +20 (1) for "session management working"
            "temporal operational" scores +20 (1) for "time awareness functional"
            "config corrupted" scores -30 (-1) for "configuration invalid"

        cascade multipliers:
            "system-wide" multiplies by 2.0 because "configuration affects everything"

